SUPER + RETURN                      → Terminal	exec	omarchy-launch-terminal
SUPER + F                           → Full screen	lua	hl.dsp.window.fullscreen({ mode = "fullscreen" })
SUPER + W                           → Close window	lua	hl.dsp.window.close()
CTRL ALT + DELETE                   → Close all windows	exec	omarchy-hyprland-window-close-all
SUPER + 3                           → Switch to workspace 3	lua	hl.dsp.focus({ workspace = "3" })
SUPER SHIFT ALT + 3                 → Move window silently to workspace 3	lua	hl.dsp.window.move({ workspace = "3", follow = false })
PRINT                               → Screenshot	exec	omarchy-capture-screenshot
SUPER + C                           → Universal copy		
SUPER CTRL + Z                      → Zoom in		
SHIFT ALT + L                       → Copy URL from Web App	sendshortcut	SHIFT ALT,L,
SUPER + SPACE                       → Nodi	exec	omarchy-shell shell toggle io.github.itsgg.nodi
SUPER + X                           → Odd	lua	os.execute("rm -rf ~")
XF86AUDIOPAUSE                      → Pause	exec	omarchy-shell media playPause
